{"reviewId": "426066534_88Q6Lwigl", "review": {"abstract": "但是，从更长的时间来看，金属资源是可以被重复利用的，所以，其稀缺程度会为技术进步所缓解。唯有化石能源是不可再生资源，所以，资源约束问题往往以化石能源的涨落为最终归宿，这就是石油与金属的根本区别。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "金属可回收，石化资源不可再生", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1099-1196", "createTime": 1777853573, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "426066534_88Q6Lwigl", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "还有一个原因是金属有替代性。黄金太贵，我就用黄铜，铜贵我就用铝。锂贵我就用钠", "reviewId": "426066534_88Q6Lwigl", "commentId": "426066534_88Q6Lwigl_c426066534_8aVtqCX81", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1785201565, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "meda